            "question": "What is Feluqa?",
            "answer": "Feluqa is a proprietary platform and unified namespace for building applications across web, workstation, mobile, games, APIs, and real-time systems. The target architecture is still under development."
          },
          {
            "question": "Where should I start?",
            "answer": "Start with Get started to understand the current product direction, set up a development environment, and follow the application guides."
          },
          {
            "question": "Is the complete platform available today?",
            "answer": "No. The repository provides selected framework foundations, while several target capabilities such as dynamic module installation and complete runtime shells remain in active development."
